### 1. 회원가입 - 정상
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "1234",
  "nickname": "테스터"
}

###

### 2. 회원가입 - username 중복 (400 응답 확인)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "5678",
  "nickname": "중복유저"
}

###

### 3. 로그인 - 정상 (JWT 토큰 확인)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "1234"
}

###

### 4. 로그인 - 틀린 비밀번호 (400 응답 확인)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### 5. 로그인 - 존재하지 않는 유저 (400 응답 확인)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "nouser",
  "password": "1234"
}
